# Xorg driver for X11 sessions (Sxmo, LXQt): auto | opentegra | modesetting
# opentegra (GPU 2D/3D EXA) is faster with kernel patch 0010 and was
# tested in Sxmo and LXQt; modesetting is the long-verified fallback.
# auto = try Tegra 2D acceleration, fall back to modesetting if X fails twice.
# Change with: nuraxoom-display <mode>
modesetting
